{"_id":"68a7360d8ec3d8323af124eb","nodeId":"XbM4TDImSH-56NsITjyHK","roadmapSlug":"backend","createdAt":"2025-08-21T15:06:53.149Z","description":"# InfluxDB\n\nInfluxDB is a high-performance, open-source time-series database for handling timestamped data like metrics and events. Optimized for monitoring, IoT, and APM with SQL-like Flux queries. Features retention policies, downsampling, and automatic compaction for scalable time-series storage.","resources":[{"type":"official","title":"InfluxDB Documentation","url":"https://docs.influxdata.com/influxdb/cloud/","_id":"6a7588bab0650226a5eb461e"},{"type":"article","title":"Time series database","url":"https://www.influxdata.com/time-series-database/","_id":"6a7588bab0650226a5eb461f"},{"type":"article","title":"Introduction to InfluxDB - DigitalOcean","url":"https://www.digitalocean.com/community/tutorials/how-to-monitor-system-metrics-with-the-tick-stack-on-centos-7","_id":"6a7588bab0650226a5eb4620"},{"type":"video","title":"The Basics of Time Series Data","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wBWTj-1XiRU","_id":"6a7588bab0650226a5eb4621"}],"updatedAt":"2026-08-07T07:26:50.654Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a5e04ddfb5fcb94d0416a19","title":"Scrimba - Backend Developer Career Path","partner":"Scrimba","type":"course","url":"http://scrimba.com/the-backend-developer-path-c0tbi0l98f?via=roadmap"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/backend/content/XbM4TDImSH-56NsITjyHK.md"}
